			"notes": "- Merged @bigsir24 's bug fixes into BTA Fixes\n- Fixes incoming packet queue overloading\n- Makes PacketBlockRegionUpdate use a cached byte arrays\n- SpawnerMobs -> Replaced new ChunkCoordinate() call with separate methods\n- ChunkProviderServer -> Changed keys from Integer to ChunkCoordinate\n- ChunkProviderClient -> Map and List is replaced when unloadAllChunks() is called\n\n- Fixed basket pushing sometimes causing a casting issue in multiplayer (thanks @MelonMojito)\n\n## What's Changed\n* Multiplayer improvements by @bigsir24 in https://github.com/UselessBullets/7.3-fixer/pull/1\n* Basket Pushing Client Bug Temporary Fix by @MelonMojito in https://github.com/UselessBullets/7.3-fixer/pull/2\n\n## New Contributors\n* @bigsir24 made their first contribution in https://github.com/UselessBullets/7.3-fixer/pull/1\n* @MelonMojito made their first contribution in https://github.com/UselessBullets/7.3-fixer/pull/2\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/UselessBullets/7.3-fixer/compare/v1.1.0...v1.2.0"
